<https://pham-ng.github.io/Vietnam-University-Knowledge-Graph-ver2/resource/university/truong-dai-hoc-dong-thap> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Organization> .
