<https://pham-ng.github.io/Vietnam-University-Knowledge-Graph-ver2/resource/person/nguyen-xuan-phuong-2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://pham-ng.github.io/Vietnam-University-Knowledge-Graph-ver2/ontology#Person> .
